  "descriptionHtml": "<p>Our Carter backpack is the one that actually fits your life. 100% recycled nylon keeps it lightweight, and interior and exterior pockets mean everything is within quick reach. The top grab handle gets you through the turnstile, and a zip closure keeps it all secure. Commute-tested, weekend-approved.</p>\n<div class=\"product-specifications\" style=\"margin-top: 1.5rem;\">\n<h4 style=\"font-size: 0.875rem; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.05em; margin-bottom: 0.75rem;\">Specifications & Details</h4>\n<ul style=\"list-style-type: none; padding-left: 0; font-size: 0.875rem; line-height: 1.6;\">\n<li><strong>Material:</strong> 100% recycled nylon</li>\n<li><strong>Lining:</strong> Fabric lining</li>\n<li><strong>Hardware:</strong> Gold hardware (deep cherry, hot fudge, black); silver hardware (pale hydrangea)</li>\n<li><strong>Handle Drop:</strong> 3.5&quot; handle drop</li>\n<li><strong>Pockets:</strong> Interior: 2 slip pockets</li>\n<li><strong>Closure:</strong> Zip closure</li>\n<li><strong>Bag Dimensions:</strong> 9.4&quot; (L) x 12.6&quot; (H) x 5.90&quot; (W)</li>\n</ul>\n</div>",
